    {
      "text": "A photograph of a person seen from behind, silhouetted against a computer monitor displaying a RapidSMS Rwanda web report ('NATION WIDE, 01/SEP/2013 - 19/SEP/2013') with browser tabs for Google Translate, RapidSMS Rwanda and related pages. The visible table has columns for Location, Type, Reporter and Patient, with rows recording community health worker reports such as 'Community Based Nutrition', 'Pregnancy' and 'Community Case Management' from locations including Rukoma, Jarama and Gishari. Illustrates the AXIS 6 Monitoring & evaluation section.",
